# ---- Large artefacts kept out of version control ----
# The full training set (ml_training_dataset_v2.csv, ~1.5GB) and the
# intermediate per-grid historical rows (~1GB) are regenerated by
# data-pipeline/pipeline/. A 120k-row sample lives in
# data-pipeline/samples/ instead. See data-pipeline/README.md.
ml_training_dataset*.csv
!ml_training_dataset_clean_sample.csv
historical_grid_training_rows.csv
historical_reconstructed_1993_2020.csv
historical_reconstructed_1993_2020_overridden.csv
rainfall_hourly_multistation.csv
river_level_hourly_multistation.csv
*_RAW_DEBUG.csv

# Source rasters (ESA WorldCover tile ~1.3GB, Copernicus DEM) are downloaded,
# not committed -- acquisition instructions are in data-pipeline/README.md.
*.tif
*.tif.aux.xml
*.img

# Random Forest weights are 384MB after the depth fix, over GitHub's limit.
models/model_random_forest.joblib
models/model_xgboost_v1.joblib

